arc-motion-path:
Arc Motion Path - advanced HyperFrames primitive.

  This is intentionally seekable: drive it from a paused GSAP timeline.
  MotionPath examples require GSAP MotionPathPlugin. Three.js examples expose
  a render(progress) adapter instead of a free-running requestAnimationFrame loop.
Timeline integration:
  const startTime = 0;
  if (window.MotionPathPlugin) gsap.registerPlugin(MotionPathPlugin); tl.to('.hf-advanced-arc-motion-path .chip-a', { motionPath: { path: '#arc-motion-path-path-a', align: '#arc-motion-path-path-a', alignOrigin: [0.5, 0.5], autoRotate: true }, duration: 2.4, ease: 'power1.inOut' }, startTime); tl.to('.hf-advanced-arc-motion-path .chip-b', { motionPath: { path: '#arc-motion-path-path-b', align: '#arc-motion-path-path-b', alignOrigin: [0.5, 0.5], autoRotate: true, start: 0.1, end: 0.92 }, duration: 2.1, ease: 'sine.inOut' }, startTime + 0.25);

