      column per character. Whitespace is stripped, and blank or non-text input
      falls back to the default three. Every reel starts on a zero.
    - direction (up | down, default up): which way the reels roll. up lifts the
      zero out through the top, down drops it out through the bottom.
    - size (small | standard | large, default standard): reel height and type
      size, 48px, 74px or 104px. The roll distance is scaled by the same factor,
      so whatever the size the reel still lands exactly one row on.

